I've got similar effects when my pet ate priests in temples.  Apparently
once the priest is dead, the temple has a chance of being haunted.
You don't have the calming influence of the priest any more to keep
all the spirits at bay.  Sometimes your spine shivers, sometimes a
ghost appears, etc.  I don't think that wraiths have anything to do
with it -- the source code only suggests the creation of ghosts.

When a Random ghost is created in the game, it sometimes chooses
names of previous characters (bones files or score list, I don't
know off hand which), which would be why your name is frequent.
Don't sweat it -- ghosts are rather easy to deal with.

